    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds nice in theory but some people argue that too much change can actually weaken the social fabric and make it harder for people to feel connected to a single national identity. do u think there's a point where we lose the core of what makes us \"us\" if we focus too much on the new influences?",
